Technology/Software Lists: Oracle, SAP, Microsoft, IBM, PeopleSoft,
Salesforce.com, JD Edwards, Citrix, Intel, etc.

 

We can help you with CUSTOM built lists as per you specific requirement. 

 

Looking forward to do business with you...

 

 

Best Regards,
Alice Nelson
Marketing Consultant

 

